Christina's final game is the most  important of all determining what and  who will survive or go extinct so while  the real world slowly decays and any  remaining human or host Survivors die  off her game will continue in the  sublime Teddy disappears he has served  his purpose and Christina now morphing  into her true role as Dolores notice her  hair has turned back to blonde rebuilds  the sublime just like the original  Westworld this new game like Westworld  will reveal what will become of human  and host will Dolores become this  Godlike figure determining through her  Recreation and simulations if humanity  and hosts are worthy of survival the  prize for winning I would imagine would  be bringing them back out into the real  world to reclaim the Earth remember that  time works differently in the sublime so  Dolores could technically spend our  equivalent of thousands of years there  before making her decision and having to  come back we learned in episode 1 that  the generators at the Hoover Dam were  recently retrofitted to last at least  another 100 years with no maintenance we  also know that doors into the sublime  can be opened from both the inside and  out meaning theoretically if a host has  the proper key they could make it back  to the real world and shut off the  sublime for good the season ends back  where season 1 began that old-timey  piano playing the same song The  Westworld train this time appearing out  of thin air and Dolores walking down the  crowded Sweetwater Street wondering if  this time will set ourselves free it  makes me question everything we've seen  in season one could this entire show  just be one big Dolores simulation we've  merely been experiencing one of  potentially thousands of Loops created  by her whatever it is this acts like a  complete reset meaning many of the  characters who were killed off can be  brought back just how this plays out  remains to be seen but the show Runners  have stated they like to make each  season feel unique and it seems like  we're coming full circle for the show to  end with season five but what did you  think of the finale any big theories for  season 5 let me know in the comments  below thanks for watching everyone be  sure to like And subscribe and for more  bad takes you can follow me on Twitter  and Instagram at thinkstory YT until  next time remember maybe this time  we'll set ourselves free
 

